      "expected": "Verify ownership of the connected process and its isolated profile before any mutation. Manage only processes launched for this probe, and refuse unrelated occupied endpoints without terminating them.",
      "evidence": "scripts/verify-dev-dx-audit.py:177–214; docs/verification/developer-dx-audit-2026-09-13.md:29–38 and :77. The ledger records an actual wrong-instance attachment."
