    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "path": "docs/research/developer-dx-audit-2026-09-13.md",
      "issue": "Navigation evidence still overstates verification. The report claims stillDirty: true after switching, but the JSON records false. Ctrl+S is then tested on an already-clean buffer. Settings/Reading focus coverage is deferred without a concrete tooling limitation, and explorer Escape restoration is claimed without recording restored focus.",
